{{!
    @template theme_dimensions/related_band

    The related courses band: a heading and the related courses as cards, each leading to the course's
    landing page. Drawn at the end of a landing page (landing_page::related()) and by the [relatedcourses]
    shortcode (theme_dimensions/related_block), from output\related_band. Its cards are the trail's course
    cards (theme_dimensions/landing_page) without a number or a state; their covers are images, never a
    style attribute. The heading's id is unique per band, since a page may carry several shortcodes.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * region - The band's data-region: the landing page's or the shortcode's.
    * cards - The courses: courseid, name (plain), url, imageurl (a url or a data URI, or null), category (plain
      or null), hours (or null).

    Example context (json):
    {
        "region": "dimensions-landing-related",
        "cards": [
            {"courseid": 51, "name": "Advanced Life Support", "url": "https://example.com/theme/dimensions/landing.php?id=51", "imageurl": "https://example.com/pluginfile.php/9/course/overviewfiles/als.jpg", "category": "Emergency care", "hours": "40 hours"},
            {"courseid": 52, "name": "Triage in Mass Casualty Incidents", "url": "https://example.com/theme/dimensions/landing.php?id=52", "imageurl": null, "category": null, "hours": null}
        ],
        "count": 2
    }
}}
<section class="dimensions-landing__related" data-region="{{region}}" aria-labelledby="{{region}}-title-{{uniqid}}">
    <h2 class="dimensions-landing__sectiontitle" id="{{region}}-title-{{uniqid}}">{{#str}} landing_related, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</h2>
    <ul class="dimensions-landing__relatedlist">
        {{#cards}}
            <li class="dimensions-landing__relateditem" data-courseid="{{courseid}}">
                <article class="dimensions-landing__stepcard">
                    <div class="dimensions-landing__stepcover" aria-hidden="true">
                        {{#imageurl}}<img src="{{.}}" alt="" loading="lazy">{{/imageurl}}
                    </div>
                    <div class="dimensions-landing__stepbody">
                        {{#category}}
                            <span class="dimensions-landing__stepcat">{{.}}</span>
                        {{/category}}
                        <h3 class="dimensions-landing__stepname"><a href="{{url}}">{{name}}</a></h3>
                        {{#hours}}
                            <div class="dimensions-landing__stepmeta">
                                <span class="dimensions-landing__stephours">{{.}}</span>
                            </div>
                        {{/hours}}
                    </div>
                </article>
            </li>
        {{/cards}}
    </ul>
</section>
